# Local-development secrets for `wrangler dev`. Copy to `.dev.vars` (which is
# gitignored) and paste real values. For production deploys, use
#   wrangler secret put STRAVA_CLIENT_ID
#   wrangler secret put STRAVA_CLIENT_SECRET
# instead — the deployed Worker reads from Cloudflare's secret store, not this
# file.

# Strava OAuth (https://www.strava.com/settings/api).
STRAVA_CLIENT_ID="123456"
STRAVA_CLIENT_SECRET="your-strava-client-secret"
